  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU &#x2013; Community Stabilization Programme Phase IV (EU-CSP IV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a continuation of the Instrument for Pre-Accession Assistance support to non-majority communities in Kosovo with the aim of stabilising their socio-economic and employment prospects and inclusion of non-majority communities. The initiative is in line with the Europe 2020 priorities particularly &#x201c;Inclusive growth: fostering high employment economy delivering social and territorial cohesion&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
